index 0000000..68cb0e3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+Let every ``pysemver`` subcommand accept an optional leading ``v`` or ``V``
+on version arguments, for example ``v1.4.2``. Output is printed without it.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ab2a34a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Passing a :class:`dict` to :meth:`~semver.version.Version.compare` is deprecated
+and now emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`. Use a str, tuple, list or
+:class:`~semver.version.Version` instead.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..83fa04e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+The ``prerelease_token`` keyword of :meth:`~semver.version.Version.next_version`
+is deprecated and emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`. Use ``token`` instead,
+which matches :meth:`~semver.version.Version.bump_prerelease`.
